---
// A price series cut into overlapping windows. Window 1 = days 1-20 predicts day 21,
// window 2 slides one day. 500 prices with a 20-day window give 480 samples.
const N = 30;
const X0 = 40;
const DX = 17;
const pts = Array.from({ length: N }, (_, i) => {
  const y = 175 - 34 * Math.sin(i * 0.45) - 22 * Math.sin(i * 1.2 + 0.6) - i * 1.1;
  return [X0 + i * DX, y] as [number, number];
});
const line = pts.map((p) => p.join(',')).join(' ');
const w1x = X0 - 6;
const w1w = 19 * DX + 12;
const t1 = pts[20];
const t2 = pts[21];
---
<figure class="p15w">
  <div class="scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 335" role="img" aria-label="A price line over 30 days. A gold band covers days 1 to 20 and a red dot marks day 21, the value to predict. A dashed band shifted one day covers days 2 to 21 and predicts day 22. On the right, a list of samples: sample 1 is days 1 to 20 predicting day 21, and 500 prices give 480 such samples.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>One long series becomes many small examples</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một chuỗi dài thành nhiều ví dụ nhỏ</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="48" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>Each example is a window of the past plus the value that came next.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi ví dụ là một cửa sổ quá khứ cùng giá trị xuất hiện ngay sau đó.</tspan></text>

    <rect x={w1x} y="86" width={w1w} height="176" rx="6" class="win1" />
    <rect x={w1x + DX} y="94" width={w1w} height="176" rx="6" class="win2" />
    <polyline points={line} class="line" />
    <circle cx={t1[0]} cy={t1[1]} r="6" class="target" />
    <circle cx={t2[0]} cy={t2[1]} r="5" class="target2" />
    <line x1="30" y1="284" x2="560" y2="284" class="axis" />
    <text x="40" y="304" class="lab"><tspan data-lang-en>day 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngày 1</tspan></text>
    <text x={X0 + 19 * DX} y="304" class="lab" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>day 20</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngày 20</tspan></text>
    <text x={X0 + 20 * DX + 14} y="74" class="tgt"><tspan data-lang-en>day 21: the answer</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngày 21: đáp án</tspan></text>
    <text x={X0 - 6} y="74" class="win-l"><tspan data-lang-en>window 1: input</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cửa sổ 1: đầu vào</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="324" class="win-l2"><tspan data-lang-en>dashed: window 2, one day later</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nét đứt: cửa sổ 2, lùi một ngày</tspan></text>

    <rect x="600" y="86" width="280" height="190" rx="6" class="panel" />
    <text x="614" y="110" class="ph"><tspan data-lang-en>The training table</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bảng huấn luyện</tspan></text>
    <text x="614" y="142" class="row"><tspan data-lang-en>sample 1: days 1–20 → day 21</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mẫu 1: ngày 1–20 → ngày 21</tspan></text>
    <text x="614" y="168" class="row"><tspan data-lang-en>sample 2: days 2–21 → day 22</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mẫu 2: ngày 2–21 → ngày 22</tspan></text>
    <text x="614" y="194" class="row">…</text>
    <text x="614" y="220" class="row"><tspan data-lang-en>sample 480: days 480–499 → day 500</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mẫu 480: ngày 480–499 → ngày 500</tspan></text>
    <text x="614" y="252" class="shape"><tspan data-lang-en>shape: 480 × 20 × 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kích thước: 480 × 20 × 1</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Say we have 500 daily prices and a 20-day window: 500 − 20 = 480 samples, each with 20 steps and 1 feature. Neighbouring samples share 19 of their 20 days, which matters when you split train from test.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giả sử có 500 giá đóng cửa và cửa sổ 20 ngày: 500 − 20 = 480 mẫu, mỗi mẫu 20 bước và 1 đặc trưng. Hai mẫu liền kề dùng chung 19 trong 20 ngày, điều này quan trọng khi tách train và test.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p15w { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p15w .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p15w svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .p15w text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p15w .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p15w .sub, .p15w .lab { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p15w .line { fill: none; stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .p15w .win1 { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .p15w .win2 { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .p15w .target { fill: var(--red); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 2; }
  .p15w .target2 { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .p15w .tgt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .p15w .win-l { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p15w .win-l2 { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p15w .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .p15w .panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p15w .ph { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p15w .row { fill: var(--text); font-size: 13px; }
  .p15w .shape { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .p15w figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
